{"id":9140542800090,"title":"Quad Cortex mini","handle":"quad-cortex-mini","description":"<p><strong>Quad Cortex mini</strong> は、Neural DSP が誇るフラッグシップ <strong>Quad Cortex</strong> の体験を、コンパクトで使いやすいフォーマットに凝縮した次世代フロア型アンプモデラー＆マルチエフェクターです。</p>\n<p>Quad Cortex と同等の処理能力とオーディオ品質を実現し、<strong>Neural Capture 技術</strong> と <strong>7インチのタッチディスプレイ</strong> を搭載。直感的な操作で、自由度の高いシグナルチェーンを構築できます。</p>\n<p>さらに、<strong>Cortex Cloud</strong> を活用すれば、プリセットやキャプチャデータを簡単に管理・共有可能。コミュニティが作成した数千種類の Neural Capture にもアクセスできます。<br><br></p>","published_at":"2026-01-30T10:00:05+09:00","created_at":"2026-01-15T12:39:53+09:00","vendor":"Neural DSP 日本公式オンラインストア","type":"Hardware","tags":["qcm"],"price":21900000,"price_min":21900000,"price_max":21900000,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":null,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":47337202254042,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"140001","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"name":"Quad Cortex mini","public_title":null,"options":["Default Title"],"price":21900000,"weight":0,"compare_at_price":null,"inventory_management":"shopify","barcode":"0655729138499","quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"quantity_price_breaks":[],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_allocations":[]}],"images":["//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0747/8109/8202/files/0001.png?v=1768889669","//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0747/8109/8202/files/0002.png?v=1768889767","//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0747/8109/8202/files/0003.png?v=1768889788","//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0747/8109/8202/files/0004.png?v=1768889802"],"featured_image":"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0747/8109/8202/files/0001.png?v=1768889669","options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"url":"/products/quad-cortex-mini","media":[{"alt":null,"id":41370556530906,"position":1,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1,"height":5000,"w